- **Binary:** `internal/extras/extras/ElleKit.framework/ElleKit` — fat **arm64 + arm64e**,
  version **1.1.3**
- **Upstream:** https://github.com/evelyneee/ElleKit (BSD 3-Clause; copyright ElleKit Team)
- **Purpose:** the `--ellekit` injection runtime (see `feather-ellekit-spec.md`, decisions D1/D7/D8)
- **Rebuild recipe:** `docs/ellekit-build.md` (verified build + assembly steps)
- **Note:** the embedded `CydiaSubstrate.framework` in this tree is **ElleKit 1.1.3 renamed**
