## Reference-only (no code copied)
- **Feather** (`claration/Feather`): GPL-3.0. Used only as a feature reference
  (`feather-ellekit-spec.md`); no Feather code is included in xkvm.
- **cyan** (`asdfzxcvbn/pyzule-rw`) and **Azule**: porting references for xkvm's design.
- **Dylib-to-Deb-Converter** (`cs59/Dylib-to-Deb-Converter`): GPL-3.0. Format
  reference for `xkvm debify` only (the deb layout is standard MobileSubstrate
  convention); no code copied.
- **Forte** (`Dr-Sauce/Forte`): no license file (an Apple Shortcut). Behavior
  reference for `xkvm undeb` (unarchive a deb, grab the dylib); no code copied.
- **rootless-patcher** (`NightwindDev/rootless-patcher`): MIT (copyright
  Nightwind). The conversion semantics of `xkvm rootless` (repack under
  var/jb, control edits, bootstrap/blacklist path rules, Mach-O load-command
  + __cstring rewrites, and the token-based script conversion of
  RPScriptHandler/RPDirectoryScanner) are ported to Go; no upstream code is
  copied. See ARCHITECTURE.md §5.4 for the documented blacklist deviation
  and the plist layer, which is warned about but not yet rewritten.
- **Derootifier** (`haxi0/Derootifier`): GPL-3.0. Format reference for the
  `xkvm rootless --tweakinject` mode only (TweakInject layout,
  @rpath/libsubstrate.dylib shim, @rpath install names, rpaths); no code
  copied.
- **Xinam1ne** (`CyPwn/Xinam1ne`, the Xinam1nePatcher script shipped in the
  AIO package): GPL-family package (Paisseon). Semantics reference for
  `xkvm rootless --xina` only (the NUL-anchored short-form byte seds,
  @rpath install-name/substrate conventions, plist and DEBIAN-script sed
  sequences); no code copied. `xkvm rootful` is the xkvm-native inverse of
  this and the rootless-patcher pipeline.
- **RootHidePatcher** (`roothide/RootHidePatcher`): GPL-3.0. Semantics
  reference for `xkvm roothide` (var/jb hoist + rootfs/ split, .jbroot
  load-command and rpath rewrites, control arm64e edits, script/plist path
  translations, pkgmirror); no code copied.

